{"id": 13530, "title": "An E-mail", "level": "Intermediate", "hsk_tags": ["HSK3"], "slug": "an-e-mail", "audio_url": "/audio/mandarin/13530_an-e-mail.mp3", "simplified_paragraphs": ["昨天我收到了一封丹尼的邮件。丹尼是我大学时候的男朋友，大学毕业以后，我在中国工作，他去加拿大继续学习。分手之后，我们已经五年没有见面了。他在邮件中告诉我，下个月他会从加拿大回国，到北京之后希望能和我见面聊天。我一晚上没有睡觉，有点儿激动，有点儿担心，有点儿期待，有点儿害怕，心情很复杂。不知道他现在变成什么样子了？他还喜欢吃辣的东西吗？长胖了吗？结婚了吗？博士毕业了吗？生活得开心吗？虽然分手让人心碎，但是我们在一起的那几年非常快乐，所以我也希望他幸福。真想马上就到下个月啊！"], "traditional_paragraphs": ["昨天我收到了一封丹尼的郵件。丹尼是我大學時候的男朋友，大學畢業以後，我在中國工作，他去加拿大繼續學習。分手之後，我們已經五年沒有見面了。他在郵件中告訴我，下個月他會從加拿大回國，到北京之後希望能和我見面聊天。我一晚上沒有睡覺，有點兒激動，有點兒擔心，有點兒期待，有點兒害怕，心情很複雜。不知道他現在變成什麼樣子了？他還喜歡吃辣的東西嗎？長胖了嗎？結婚了嗎？博士畢業了嗎？生活得開心嗎？雖然分手讓人心碎，但是我們在一起的那幾年非常快樂，所以我也希望他幸福。真想馬上就到下個月啊！"], "pinyin_paragraphs": ["zuó tiān wǒ shōu dào le yī fēng Dān ní de yóu jiàn。 Dān ní shì wǒ dà xué shí hou de nán péng you， dà xué bì yè yǐ hòu， wǒ zài Zhōng guó gōng zuò， tā qù Jiā ná dà jì xù xué xí。 fēn shǒu zhī hòu， wǒ men yǐ jīng wǔ nián méi yǒu jiàn miàn le。 tā zài yóu jiàn zhōng gào su wǒ， xià gè yuè tā huì cóng Jiā ná dà huí guó， dào Běi jīng zhī hòu xī wàng néng hé wǒ jiàn miàn liáo tiān。 wǒ yī wǎn shang méi yǒu shuì jiào， yǒu diǎn r jī dòng， yǒu diǎn r dān xīn， yǒu diǎn r qī dài， yǒu diǎn r hài pà， xīn qíng hěn fù zá。 bù zhī dào tā xiàn zài biàn chéng shén me yàng zi le？ tā hái xǐ huan chī là de dōng xi ma？ zhǎng pàng le ma？ jié hūn le ma？ bó shì bì yè le ma？ shēng huó de kāi xīn ma？ suī rán fēn shǒu ràng rén xīn suì， dàn shì wǒ men zài yī qǐ de nà jǐ nián fēi cháng kuài lè， suǒ yǐ wǒ yě xī wàng tā xìng fú。 zhēn xiǎng mǎ shàng jiù dào xià gè yuè a！"], "english_paragraphs": ["Yesterday I received an email from Danny. Danny was my boyfriend in college. After graduating from college, I worked in China and he went to Canada to continue his studies. After the breakup, we didn't see each other for five years. He told me in the email that he will return to China from Canada next month and hopes to meet and chat with me after arriving in Beijing. I didn't sleep all night. I was a little excited, a little worried, a little looking forward to it, a little scared, and my mood was very complicated. I wonder what he has become now? Does he still like spicy food? Have you gained weight? Married? Have you graduated with a PhD? Are you happy with your life? Although the breakup was heartbreaking, we had a very happy few years together, so I wanted him to be happy too. I really want to go to next month soon!"], "english_full": "Yesterday I received an email from Danny. Danny was my boyfriend in college. After graduating from college, I worked in China and he went to Canada to continue his studies. After the breakup, we didn't see each other for five years. He told me in the email that he will return to China from Canada next month and hopes to meet and chat with me after arriving in Beijing. I didn't sleep all night. I was a little excited, a little worried, a little looking forward to it, a little scared, and my mood was very complicated. I wonder what he has become now? Does he still like spicy food? Have you gained weight? Married? Have you graduated with a PhD? Are you happy with your life? Although the breakup was heartbreaking, we had a very happy few years together, so I wanted him to be happy too. I really want to go to next month soon!", "ruby_paragraphs": ["<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"zuó tiān\" data-defn=\"yesterday\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">昨天</span><span class=\"tr\">昨天</span><rt>zuó tiān</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"wǒ\" data-defn=\"I; me; my\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">我</span><span class=\"tr\">我</span><rt>wǒ</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"shōu\" data-defn=\"to receive / to accept / to collect\" data-hsk=\"HSK 4\"><span class=\"si\">收</span><span class=\"tr\">收</span><rt>shōu</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"dào\" data-defn=\"to reach; to arrive / to (a place); until (a time); up to (a point) / (verb complement indicating arriving at a place or reaching a point)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 2\"><span class=\"si\">到</span><span class=\"tr\">到</span><rt>dào</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"le\" data-defn=\"(completed action marker) / (modal particle indicating change of state, situation now)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">了</span><span class=\"tr\">了</span><rt>le</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"yī\" data-defn=\"one / single / a (article)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">一</span><span class=\"tr\">一</span><rt>yī</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"fēng\" data-defn=\"classifier for sealed objects, esp. letters\" data-hsk=\"HSK 3(6)\"><span class=\"si\">封</span><span class=\"tr\">封</span><rt>fēng</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"Dān ní\" data-defn=\"Danny (name)\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">丹尼</span><span class=\"tr\">丹尼</span><rt>Dān ní</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"de\" data-defn=\"possessive particle (of; &#x27;s) / modifying particle (used after an attribute to modify a noun or to form a nominal expression)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">的</span><span class=\"tr\">的</span><rt>de</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"yóu jiàn\" data-defn=\"mail / post / email\" data-hsk=\"HSK 3\"><span class=\"si\">邮件</span><span class=\"tr\">郵件</span><rt>yóu jiàn</rt></ruby>。<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"Dān ní\" data-defn=\"Danny (name)\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">丹尼</span><span class=\"tr\">丹尼</span><rt>Dān ní</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"shì\" data-defn=\"to be (followed by substantives only)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">是</span><span class=\"tr\">是</span><rt>shì</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"wǒ\" data-defn=\"I; me; my\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">我</span><span class=\"tr\">我</span><rt>wǒ</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"dà xué\" data-defn=\"university / college\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">大学</span><span class=\"tr\">大學</span><rt